{"mode":"words","text":"Sekarang, dengarkan teksnya sambil membacanya. Sebagai pemula, bacalah baris arti dalam bahasa ibu Anda, dengarkan bahasa target secara perlahan, dan sering-seringlah menekan tombol jeda — dengan begitu, otak Anda akan mengaitkan bunyi dengan maknanya. Sebagai pelajar tingkat lanjut, bacalah teks aslinya dan lihatlah ke bawah sebentar hanya saat menemukan kata-kata yang tidak dikenal. Gunakanlah metode pengulangan A-B sesering mungkin: tandai satu kalimat dan putar ulang secara berulang — coba lakukan di atas.","words":[{"s":0,"e":813},{"s":964,"e":1416},{"s":1474,"e":1811},{"s":1858,"e":2171},{"s":2229,"e":3111},{"s":3495,"e":3866},{"s":3913,"e":4621},{"s":4830,"e":5248},{"s":5294,"e":5561},{"s":5619,"e":5968},{"s":6026,"e":6246},{"s":6304,"e":6618},{"s":6664,"e":6885},{"s":6954,"e":7488},{"s":7767,"e":8185},{"s":8243,"e":8568},{"s":8626,"e":8963},{"s":8998,"e":9346},{"s":9404,"e":10089},{"s":10367,"e":10495},{"s":10553,"e":11261},{"s":11308,"e":11644},{"s":11691,"e":11981},{"s":12051,"e":12411},{"s":12492,"e":12782},{"s":12991,"e":13235},{"s":13281,"e":13943},{"s":14187,"e":14466},{"s":14535,"e":14756},{"s":14779,"e":14988},{"s":15035,"e":15580},{"s":15638,"e":15940},{"s":15998,"e":16219},{"s":16277,"e":16927},{"s":17624,"e":18007},{"s":18053,"e":18378},{"s":18436,"e":18692},{"s":18750,"e":19237},{"s":19446,"e":19876},{"s":19911,"e":20108},{"s":20166,"e":20712},{"s":21095,"e":21246},{"s":21292,"e":21722},{"s":21757,"e":21838},{"s":21884,"e":22151},{"s":22175,"e":22686},{"s":22929,"e":23208},{"s":23254,"e":23510},{"s":23568,"e":24067},{"s":24137,"e":24682},{"s":24717,"e":24822},{"s":24868,"e":25100},{"s":25124,"e":25704},{"s":26308,"e":26912},{"s":26946,"e":27329},{"s":27388,"e":27887},{"s":27968,"e":28165},{"s":28340,"e":28804},{"s":28850,"e":29315},{"s":29640,"e":29942},{"s":29988,"e":30197},{"s":30244,"e":30696},{"s":30766,"e":30882},{"s":30940,"e":31219},{"s":31277,"e":31509},{"s":31579,"e":31846},{"s":31904,"e":32391},{"s":32508,"e":325